    },
    {
      "id": "c0002p0051",
      "chapter": 2,
      "source": "这里是宿舍楼后方的静谧之处，在此刻绝大部分学生都赶去教学楼的情况下，更是几乎看不到人影。",
      "source_hash": "04ea39f188570082a04bf2424bf1cab5d270b440195b7fee4a0a414ed1c5c9f9",
      "package_hash": "f22a4e03d002b0bc71f02233ef08e60e4daf6f0e2f88278c20cec5fdbfcdb7fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0002p0052",
      "chapter": 2,
      "source": "白真真便站在一处花坛前，一听到张羽的脚步声她就转过身来，快步走到了他的面前。",
      "source_hash": "29d50c4feb10bb3e16b4bba4fe4d5a5dbff9c3825559e9e7a0f54fb84634782d",
      "package_hash": "f22a4e03d002b0bc71f02233ef08e60e4daf6f0e2f88278c20cec5fdbfcdb7fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "c0002p0069",
      "chapter": 2,
      "source": "“你现在才高一花钱就这么猛？”",
